{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/UntiY7G7Gtled.png?t=1749603195\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/ezgif-51e0e2757f0534.gif?t=1749603195\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Mansa Musa's gold was hidden away within an a cave in the underworld, guarded by vicious demons he had captured on his many journeys.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>LESSER DEMONS</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RED DEMON\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/bad.png?t=1749603195\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BLUE DEMON</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/bad_b.png?t=1749603195\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GREEN DEMON</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/green2.png?t=1749603195\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YELLOW DEMON</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/hero.png?t=1749603195\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PINK DEMON</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/pink2.png?t=1749603195\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PURPLE DEMON\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/purple2.png?t=1749603195\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>GREATER DEMONS</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Grootslang</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_para